    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so is it specifically the cocoa butter crystals that cause this bloom? i'm trying to understand the chemistry behind the temperature curve. like, what's actually happening at a molecular level when the tempering goes wrong?",
      "source": "evaluator"
